      "created_at": "2016-09-21T23:56:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm also from Canada and I'm a bit confused because when I looked up the cost to buy the season 2 pass on steam it is also $27.99. So is there no discount for iOS players in Canada?</p>",
