      "username": "Matchstickman",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-09-22T00:14:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Steam is not getting a discount, only Mobile is. And only then because (presumably) you backed the kickstarter at the $5 mobile level and are now playing the discounted price of $20 for a total of $25, the same price as the game was to Steam backers in the Kickstarter.</p><p>Some people will get the Season Pass at $20 thanks to the generousity of others, others will pay the full $25 and some paid $5 just to give the discount to others for longer.</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:07:34.075Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
