      "raw": "<p>The discount is worldwide. The regular price is $24.99 USD and it&#39;s $5 off, so $19.99 USD.</p><p>The regular price of Season Pass 2 on iOS in Canada is $34.99 CAD and with the sale applied it&#39;s $27.99 CAD.</p><p>We do not control international exchange rates, nor the exchange rate policies of the different stores we sell on. We price things in USD and they are automatically converted. Some stores keep up to date with exchange rates better than others.</p>",
